1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,667
Jason found the cash just as the
container door slammed. Outside, Lucia

2
00:00:04,667 --> 00:00:07,000
heard the bolt fall into place.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,056
He called through the steel. His phone
had no signal. Hers showed water

4
00:00:12,056 --> 00:00:14,000
rising around the lower hinges.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,353
The container sat below the pier,
waiting for a crane that had stopped

6
00:00:19,353 --> 00:00:21,000
when the storm arrived.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,353
Jason stacked the money beneath the
roof. Then he noticed an old tide

8
00:00:26,353 --> 00:00:28,000
stain above his shoulders.

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,444
Lucia found the release bar bent under a
fallen pallet. She could move the

10
00:00:33,444 --> 00:00:35,000
timber, or fetch help.

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,941
She stayed. Jason shoved from inside
while she dragged the pallet clear.

12
00:00:39,941 --> 00:00:42,000
The bolt finally slid back.

13
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,941
He came out carrying nothing. Behind
him, the floating cash spread across

14
00:00:46,941 --> 00:00:49,000
the container like expensive confetti.

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:54,444
Lucia asked about the money. Jason
pointed at the stain. For once, he had

16
00:00:54,444 --> 00:00:56,000
known when to quit.
